#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A successful build prints the two compile/link lines and leaves a `diag` "
"binary next to the `Makefile`. One `ld: warning: ignoring duplicate "
"libraries: '-lomp'` is harmless.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
